%% Regenerate SVG: npx @mermaid-js/mermaid-cli mmdc -i docs/diagrams/autofile-policy.mmd -o docs/diagrams/autofile-policy.svg
graph TD
    A[Agent calls a file-writing tool] --> B{Session policy}
    B -->|allow-all| OK[Allowed]
    B -->|strict-search /ar:f| E1{Target file exists?}
    B -->|justify-create /ar:j| E2{Target file exists?}
    E1 -->|Yes| OK
    E1 -->|No| X1[Blocked: search for an existing file to edit]
    E2 -->|Yes| OK
    E2 -->|No| J{AUTOFILE_JUSTIFICATION tag with a reason?}
    J -->|Yes| OK
    J -->|No| X2[Blocked: state why the file is needed]
